    {"slug": "gr-01", "voice": "F", "text": "Countable nouns are for the people and things we can count using numbers."},
    {"slug": "gr-02", "voice": "F", "text": "Countable nouns can be singular: a rock, an island, or plural: rocks, islands."},
    {"slug": "gr-03", "voice": "F", "text": "Uncountable nouns are for the things that we cannot count with numbers."},
    {"slug": "gr-04", "voice": "F", "text": "They usually do not have a plural form: cream, chocolate."},
    {"slug": "gr-05", "voice": "F", "text": "We use some, many, a few with countable nouns."},
    {"slug": "gr-06", "voice": "F", "text": "We use some, much, a little with uncountable nouns."},
    {"slug": "gr-07", "voice": "F", "text": "We use must to say that something is very necessary or very important."},
    {"slug": "gr-08", "voice": "F", "text": "We use mustn't to say that doing something is not allowed."},
    {"slug": "gr-09", "voice": "F", "text": "We must arrive on time."},
    {"slug": "gr-10", "voice": "F", "text": "We mustn't pick flowers in the school garden."},

    {"slug": "com-01", "voice": "M", "vai": "Steven", "text": "Duong, let's go for a picnic this Sunday.",
     "ten_viet": ["Duong"]},
    {"slug": "com-02", "voice": "M2", "vai": "Duong", "text": "That's fine. What time can we meet?"},
    {"slug": "com-03", "voice": "M", "vai": "Steven", "text": "How about nine o'clock?"},
    {"slug": "com-04", "voice": "M2", "vai": "Duong", "text": "Sure. I'll meet you at that time."},

    {"slug": "read-him-1", "voice": "F", "text": "The Himalayas is a mountain range. It's very special. It has the world's highest mountain – Mount Everest."},
    {"slug": "read-him-2", "voice": "F", "text": "When visiting the Himalayas, remember to follow these rules."},
    {"slug": "rule-1", "voice": "F", "text": "You must ask before you visit the area."},
    {"slug": "rule-2", "voice": "F", "text": "You mustn't travel alone. Always go in a group."},
    {"slug": "rule-3", "voice": "F", "text": "You mustn't litter."},
    {"slug": "rule-4", "voice": "F", "text": "You must bring only the necessary things."},
    {"slug": "rule-5", "voice": "F", "text": "You must bring the right clothes too. Don't bring shorts or T-shirts!"},
    {"slug": "sp-01", "voice": "F", "vai": "A", "text": "I'd like to go to the Himalayas next month."},
    {"slug": "sp-02", "voice": "M", "vai": "B", "text": "OK. I think you must bring a waterproof coat. It's cold and rainy there!"},
    {"slug": "sp-03", "voice": "F", "vai": "A", "text": "Yes. Anything else?"},

    {"slug": "read-halong", "voice": "F",
     "text": "Ha Long Bay is in Quang Ninh. It has many islands and caves. Tuan Chau, with its beautiful beaches, is a popular tourist attraction in Ha Long Bay. There you can enjoy great seafood. And you can join in exciting activities. Ha Long Bay is Viet Nam's best natural wonder.",
     "ten_viet": [{"tu": "Ha Long", "doc": "Hạ Long"}, {"tu": "Quang Ninh", "doc": "Quảng Ninh"},
                  {"tu": "Tuan Chau", "doc": "Tuần Châu"}, {"tu": "Ha Long", "doc": "Hạ Long"},
                  {"tu": "Ha Long", "doc": "Hạ Long"}, {"tu": "Viet Nam's", "doc": "Việt Nam", "giu_duoi": "'s"}]},
    {"slug": "read-muine", "voice": "F",
     "text": "Mui Ne is popular for its amazing landscapes. The sand has different colours: white, yellow, red. It's like a desert here. You can ride a bike down the slopes. You can also fly kites, or have a picnic by the beach. The best time to visit the Mui Ne Sand Dunes is early morning or late afternoon. Remember to wear suncream and bring water.",
     "ten_viet": [{"tu": "Mui Ne", "doc": "Mũi Né"}, {"tu": "Mui Ne", "doc": "Mũi Né"}]},
    {"slug": "sp-04", "voice": "F", "text": "Ha Long Bay has a lot of interesting islands.",
     "ten_viet": [{"tu": "Ha Long", "doc": "Hạ Long"}]},
    {"slug": "sp-05", "voice": "F", "text": "You must follow all the rules."},
    {"slug": "sp-06", "voice": "F", "text": "You mustn't take photos when you are in the City Museum."},

